 "sentences": [
  "Voyager 1 will hit 1 light-day away!",
  "In 1977, NASA launched twin spacecraft for a Grand Tour.",
  "They used planetary alignment and gravity assists to visit outer planets.",
  "Each craft carries a Golden Record with sounds and greetings from Earth.",
  "The record cover has uranium-238 with a half-life of 4.468 billion years.",
  "Today, Voyager 1 is over 16 billion miles from the Sun."
